    "summary": "Errata rewriting [Feed the Swarm](vsdata:ability/tyranids.assimilation-swarm.feed-the-swarm). Each **HARVESTER** unit of yours may, in your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase), Regenerate 1 friendly **TYRANIDS** unit within 6″ of it, and a unit can be regenerated only once per phase. Each regeneration does one of these:\n\n- 1 model in the unit regains lost wounds, up to D3+1\n- 1 **destroyed** **INFANTRY** model, other than a **CHARACTER**, returns to the unit with full wounds, or as many as 3 destroyed models for an **ENDLESS MULTITUDE** unit",
